{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-heb-10-1","title":"Hebrews 10:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The weakness of the law sacrifices. 10 The sacrifice of Christ's body once offered, 14 for ever hath taken away sins. 19 An exhortation to hold fast the faith with patience and thanksgiving.</p>\n<p>having. 8:5; 9:9,11,23; Col 2:17 with. 3,4,11-18; 7:18,19; 9:8,9,25 perfect. 14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-10-2","title":"Hebrews 10:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>would they not have. or, they would have. once. 17; 9:13,14; Ps 103:12; Isa 43:25; 44:22; Mic 7:19 conscience.Our translators use the word conscience here, as elsewhere, for consciousness.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-10-3","title":"Hebrews 10:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>a remembrance. 9:7; Ex 30:10; Le 16:6-11,21,22,29,30,34; 23:27,28; Nu 29:7-11 1Ki 17:18; Mt 26:28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-10-4","title":"Hebrews 10:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>not. 8; 9:9,13; Ps 50:8-12; 51:16; Isa 1:11-15; 66:3; Jer 6:20; 7:21,22 Ho 6:6; Am 5:21,22; Mic 6:6-8; Mr 12:33 take.There were essential defects in these sacrifices. 1st.--They were not of the same nature with those who sinned. 2nd.--They were not of sufficient value to make satisfaction for the affronts done to the justice and government of God. 3rd.--The beasts offered up under the law could not consent to put themselves in the sinner's room and place. The atoning sacrifice must be one capable of consenting, and must voluntarily substitute himself in the sinner's stead: Christ did so.</p>\n<p>11; Ho 14:2; Joh 1:29; Ro 11:27; 1Jo 3:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-10-5","title":"Hebrews 10:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>when. 7; 1:6; Mt 11:3; Lu 7:19; *Gr: Sacrifice. Ps 40:6-8; 50:8-23; Isa 1:11; Jer 6:20; Am 5:21,22 but. 10; 2:14; 8:3; Ge 3:15; Isa 7:14; Jer 31:22; Mt 1:20-23; Lu 1:35 Joh 1:14; Ga 4:4; 1Ti 3:16; 1Jo 4:2,3; 2Jo 1:7 hast thou prepared me. or, thou hast fitted me.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-10-6","title":"Hebrews 10:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>burnt. 4; Le 1:1-6:7 thou. Ps 147:11; Mal 1:10; Mt 3:17; Eph 5:2; Php 4:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-10-7","title":"Hebrews 10:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Lo. 9,10; Pr 8:31; Joh 4:34; 5:30; 6:38 in. Ge 3:15; *Gr:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-10-9","title":"Hebrews 10:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Lo. 9:11-14 He taketh. 7:18,19; 8:7-13; 12:27,28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-10-10","title":"Hebrews 10:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>we. 2:11; 13:12; Zec 13:1; Joh 17:19; 19:34; 1Co 1:30; 6:11; 1Jo 5:6 the offering. 5,12,14,20; 9:12,26,28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-10-11","title":"Hebrews 10:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>daily. 7:27; Ex 29:38,39; Nu 28:3,24; 29:6; Eze 45:4; Da 8:11; 9:21,27 Da 11:31; 12:11; Lu 1:9,10 which. 4; Ps 50:8-13; Isa 1:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-10-12","title":"Hebrews 10:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>1:3; 8:1; 9:12; Ac 2:33,34; Ro 8:34; Col 3: